{"full":"hf:lablab-ai-amd-developer-hackathon/ROCKET-mi300x","spaceId":"lablab-ai-amd-developer-hackathon/ROCKET-mi300x","name":"ROCKET ⚡ AI Scientist for AMD Performance","source":"huggingface","description":"Autonomous performance autopilot for AMD MI300X.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","topics":["static","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":9,"created":"2026-05-09T23:14:36.000Z","updated":"2026-05-09T23:17:39.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://lablab-ai-amd-developer-hackathon-rocket-mi300x.static.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/lablab-ai-amd-developer-hackathon/ROCKET-mi300x","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:25.267Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:25.267Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:25.267Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"⚡","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI scientist whose only research domain is making models faster on AMD MI300X.","ROCKET is a multi-agent system that takes a PyTorch model, profiles it on AMD MI300X, hypothesizes which optimizations will help, applies them, validates correctness, and measures the speedup — completely on its own. Output: a measured speedup, a research log, and a PR-ready diff.","Real result on real hardware. Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on AMD Instinct MI300X (ROCm 7), batch=8, prompt 256 + new 512: baseline 62.59 tok/s → final 183.47 tok/s. 2.93× honest speedup. The agent tried 5 tools and kept 1 (bf16 cast); rejected the 4 that didn't beat the validation threshold."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/lablab-ai-amd-developer-hackathon/ROCKET-mi300x/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"821a330cffd301a72dbbf7b699e4a97a224caf33b9330de825b822ab319b3ee6","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:25.349Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T21:22:25.349Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An AI scientist whose only research domain is making models faster on AMD M